            p Greg Reda posted this 
                a(href='http://www.gregreda.com/2015/02/15/web-scraping-finding-the-api/') tutorial
                |  on how to pull John Wall&apos;s shot logs from the 
                a(href='http://www.nba.com') NBA.com
                |  website. Unfortunately, the NBA changed the layout of NBA.com site since he published his tutorial in 2015. The data is still on the NBA.com website. We just needed to find it. There&apos;s a couple more steps to find the shot chart data:
                ol
                    li
                        | Go to the 
                        a(href='http://www.nba.com') NBA.com
                        |  website and click the 
                        a(href='http://stats.nba.com/') &quot;Stats&quot;
                        |  link
