                    li
                        | Select the 
                        a(href='http://stats.nba.com/players/traditional/#!?DateFrom=05/20/2017&DateTo=05/20/2017&PerMode=Totals&sort=PTS&dir=-1') &quot;See all Players Stats&quot;
                        |  link
                        p
